{"id":197701115,"slug":"rapid-acting-mental-health-technology","title":"Rapid Acting Mental Health Technology 2026 SF is Coming May 16th","subtitle":"Also, Owen was a guest on The Open Loop podcast.","post_date":"2026-05-14T15:55:31.777Z","audience":"everyone","type":"newsletter","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/rapid-acting-mental-health-technology","wordcount":192,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T21:43:56.240Z","body_sha256":"906100359e7aef364b1615380fad47883130466c6a6d2249860252fdcd2f5bfe","text_words":247,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p>Good morning friends.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.rapidmentalhealth.com/\">RAMHT is coming</a>!  It’s the live-action newsletter event you’ve been waiting for.  It features speakers from <a href=\"https://definiumtx.com\">Definium</a> Theraputics, <a href=\"https://www.brainsway.com\">Brainsway</a>, <a href=\"https://www.graymatters-health.com\">Graymatters Health,</a> <a href=\"https://www.salmahealth.com\">Salma Health</a>, <a href=\"https://www.mdhub.ai\">MDHub</a>, <a href=\"https://beckleyclinical.com\">Beckley Clinica</a>l, <a href=\"https://www.nrxpharma.com\">NRx</a>, <a href=\"https://www.meetradial.com\">Radial</a>, and special guests <a href=\"https://homebase.org/staff/sofia-matta-md/\">Sofia Matta, M.D.,</a> Chair of the APA Scientific Program Committee and Joe Feldman, founder of <a href=\"https://covermymentalhealth.org\">Cover My Mental Health.</a>  We are proud to welcome <a href=\"https://www.axsome.com\">Axome</a> as well!  It’s an event that has hit it’s sixth edition.  It’s May 16th—this Saturday—live in San Fran.  Join us.  I even have a free ticket code for my readers: “Free”</p><h3><strong>The Live-Action Version of this Newsletter, RAMHT 2026 SF, is coming up on May 16th, 2026!</strong></h3><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://www.eventbrite.com/e/ramht-apa-2026-san-francisco-tickets-1983465503715?utm-campaign=social&amp;utm-content=attendeeshare&amp;utm-medium=discovery&amp;utm-term=listing&amp;utm-source=cp&amp;aff=ebdsshcopyurl&amp;keep_tld=true&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Get Tickets to RAMHT 2026 SF&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:&quot;button-wrapper&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary button-wrapper\" href=\"https://www.eventbrite.com/e/ramht-apa-2026-san-francisco-tickets-1983465503715?utm-campaign=social&amp;utm-content=attendeeshare&amp;utm-medium=discovery&amp;utm-term=listing&amp;utm-source=cp&amp;aff=ebdsshcopyurl&amp;keep_tld=true\"><span>Get Tickets to RAMHT 2026 SF</span></a></p><p>Now, for some content for my readers today while I’m in transit…</p><p>I joined <a href=\"https://substack.com/@theneurotechnewsletter\">the Neurotech Newsletter’s</a> Chay Carter for his new podcast this week.  Here it is!  It’s a fun deep dive into your author’s back story and the science behind neurotech like TMS.</p><div class=\"embedded-post-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;id&quot;:197538820,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://theneurotechnewsletter.substack.com/p/the-future-of-brain-medicine-with&quot;,&quot;publication_id&quot;:8115487,&quot;embedding_publication_id&quot;:null,&quot;publication_name&quot;:&quot;The Neurotech Newsletter&quot;,&quot;publication_logo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!iHwN!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F59230550-6a26-4127-a043-b7efb32a22ae_1024x1024.png&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;The Future of Brain Medicine with Owen Muir&quot;,&quot;truncated_body_text&quot;:&quot;This written interview is an edited transcription of a recorded conversation with Owen Muir. You can watch the full video on YouTube here:&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;2026-05-13T17:32:17.091Z&quot;,&quot;like_count&quot;:6,&quot;comment_count&quot;:0,&quot;bylines&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:308653004,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Chay’s Neurotech Newsletter&quo