9Vyo?rel=0&amp;autoplay=0&amp;showinfo=0&amp;enablejsapi=0\" frameborder=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" gesture=\"media\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen\" allowautoplay=\"true\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" width=\"728\" height=\"409\"></iframe></div></div><p>Thanks for reading…and listening!</p><p>More soon, friends.  See you at APA and RAMHT!</p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><div class=\"subscription-widget-wrap-editor\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"SubscribeWidgetToDOM\"><div class=\"subscription-widget show-subscribe\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">The Frontier Psychiatrists is a reader-supported publication. To receive new posts and support my work, consider becoming a free or paid subscriber.</p></div><form class=\"subscription-widget-subscribe\"><input type=\"email\" class=\"email-input\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"Type your email…\" tabindex=\"-1\"><input type=\"submit\" class=\"button primary\" value=\"Subscribe\"><div class=\"fake-input-wrapper\"><div class=\"fake-input\"></div><div class=\"fake-button\"></div></div></form></div></div><p></p>","text":"Good morning friends.\n\nRAMHT is coming ! It’s the live-action newsletter event you’ve been waiting for. It features speakers from Definium Theraputics, Brainsway , Graymatters Health, Salma Health , MDHub , Beckley Clinica l, NRx , Radial , and special guests Sofia Matta, M.D., Chair of the APA Scientific Program Committee and Joe Feldman, founder of Cover My Mental Health. We are proud to welcome Axome as well! It’s an event that has hit it’s sixth edition. It’s May 16th—this Saturday—live in San Fran. Join us. I even have a free ticket code for my readers: “Free”\n\nThe Live-Action Version of this Newsletter, RAMHT 2026 SF, is coming up on May 16th, 2026!\n\nGet Tickets to RAMHT 2026 SF\n\nNow, for some content for my readers today while I’m in transit…\n\nI joined the Neurotech Newsletter’s Chay Carter for his new podcast this week. Here it is! It’s a fun deep dive into your author’s back story and the science behind neurotech like TMS.\n\nThe Neurotech Newsletter\n\nThe Future of Brain Medicine with Owen Muir\n\nThis written interview is an edited transcription of a recorded conversation with Owen Muir. You can watch the full video on YouTube here…\n\nRead more\n\n4 months ago · 6 likes · Chay’s Neurotech Newsletter\n\nThanks for reading…and listening!\n\nMore soon, friends. See you at APA and RAMHT!\n\nSubscribe now\n\nThe Frontier Psychiatrists is a reader-supported publication. To receive new posts and support my work, consider becoming a free or paid subscriber."}